.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:1:# Small-batch production and recovery
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:2:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:3:Use the active ticket's authorization, not the skill's usual publish default.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:4:An offline repair or a paused production assignment does not authorize DB writes,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:5:deployment or starting other workers.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:6:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:7:## Continue from facts
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:8:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:9:- Before continuing, read the latest direct human instruction and the existing
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:10:  checkpoint. A direct pause stays effective until a later direct human resume
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:11:  for that scope; old resume messages, heartbeats and completion of a repair do
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:12:  not lift it.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:13:- Collect already completed child results before dispatching replacements.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:14:  Bind the returned paths to the actual files and reuse passed stages. A
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:15:  checkpoint, batch report or context compression is not a completion condition.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:16:  When batch delivery and further production are authorized, commit/push the
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:17:  completed small batch (normally about four lessons), then continue within that
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:18:  scope. An offline four-lesson experiment does not authorize a fifth lesson.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:19:- Distinguish tool execution failure, content review failure, missing/ambiguous
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:20:  source, and human approval. A bad cwd, missing output directory, read-only
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:21:  working file or output-parser error is not a scientific verdict or a permanent
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:22:  prohibition on that content.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:23:- Preserve the failed call and any valid output. Correct the identified technical
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:24:  cause and continue only the failed stage; do not redo passed authors/reviews or
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:25:  count recovery as approval. Content changes still need affected-only review.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:26:  Real content-revision, image and paid-call usage is never reset.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:27:- Read a checkpoint's HOLD reason to identify the held phase. A technical repair
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:28:  corrects its execution diagnosis, not a separate content or approval HOLD.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:29:- Stop dependent stages at their first failure. Independent completed work remains
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:30:  usable; a local gap does not block unrelated authorized lessons.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:31:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:32:## Existing tool contracts
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:33:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:34:Commands run from the exact active checkout root. Book identity is explicit;
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:35:neither the environment nor another book supplies a default.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:36:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:37:```bash
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:38:P=.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/.venv/bin/python
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:39:$P .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/production.py prepare-range \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:40:  --repo . --book <book> --first <physical-page> --last <physical-page> \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:41:  --work .tmp/ld-s10y-lesson
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:42:$P .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/production.py read-json \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:43:  --input <saved-stdout>
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:44:$P .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/retain_choices.py \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:45:  --repo . --book <book> --lesson <card-id> --source <approved-choice-directory>
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:46:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:47:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:48:Range preparation reuses complete prepared pages and stops before the next page
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:49:when a command fails. It is preparation only, never source/content approval.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:50:Use the returned machine result for control; human logs are not one JSON document.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:51:For historical mixed stdout, read all complete top-level documents without
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:52:rerunning the successful producer. Do not turn candidate presence into approval.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:53:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:54:Choice retention verifies the existing choice checker against the current lesson,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:55:its projection and assets. It refuses a wrong owner or a different existing
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:56:target; exact outputs can be reused. The seed's original index trace stays
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:57:historical: adding unrelated lessons to the book index does not invalidate
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:58:unchanged reviewed question content. Changed lesson files or assets still fail.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:59:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:60:Immutable evidence and editable outputs are different files. Keep the original
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:61:approved snapshots read-only; make a writable working copy. Modern finalization
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:62:replaces its output files, not the evidence snapshot or its permissions.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:63:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:64:When importing already approved raw lessons into a repair checkout, `p2c.py
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:65:reindex --book <book> --toc <toc.json>` derives the index from retained lesson
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:66:files without rewriting them. It is not a substitute for assembling or reviewing
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:67:new/incomplete source.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:68:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:69:## Evidence without duplicate packages
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:70:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:71:Reference the existing source/PDF/runtime path, Git revision and file hash.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:72:Keep the first failure receipt and changed candidate snapshot once. Do not copy
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:73:Node, Python, whole PDFs or a whole earlier evidence package into each new batch.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:74:Only a genuinely required changed input or output needs new bytes.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:75:Follow the image skill's bounded contexts; return text and evidence paths/hashes,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:76:not image-bearing history. Verify a completed batch once, then only affected
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/production-resume.md:77:changes after a real defect.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:1:# Edition Text Contract
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:2:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:3:## Section Boundaries
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:4:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:5:`section_breaks` is authored as adjacent final-paragraph anchors:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:6:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:7:```json
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:8:{
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:9:  "section_breaks": [
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:10:    {
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:11:      "before": "同组例式的最后一个实际段落",
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:12:      "after": "下一个概念的第一个实际段落"
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:13:    }
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:14:  ]
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:15:}
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:16:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:17:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:18:Run `node .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/prose_flow.mjs <lesson.template.json>` and copy the
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:19:reported boundary object. The command, validator, offline renderer, and publisher all use
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:20:`htmlfrag.js` `proseParagraphs`/`proseFlow`. Do not count prose blocks or blank lines independently.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:21:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:22:## Source-Bound Errata
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:23:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:24:A confirmed mathematical printing error remains unchanged in the faithful page block and is recorded
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:25:in that page's frontmatter:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:26:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:27:```json
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:28:{
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:29:  "errata": [
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:30:    {
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:31:      "id": "p0013-math-1",
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:32:      "block": "p0013#7",
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:33:      "original": "$a+b+c$",
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:34:      "reason": "The printed relation fails the stated substitution check."
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:35:    }
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:36:  ]
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:37:}
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:38:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:39:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:40:`finalize` verifies that the block exists and contains `original`. `assemble` preserves the source
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:41:block reference. `adapt-prepare` then creates the lesson-level record with the physical/printed page,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:42:page JSON SHA-256, PDF SHA-256, target, original expression, and an empty `corrected` field.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:43:`adapt-prepare`, `adapt-finalize`, and publication revalidation reconstruct the authoritative target
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:44:bindings from the page stream using the lesson identity and assembly rules. Missing legacy
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:45:`source_refs`/`pages` are recovered from that result; populated references must match it exactly or
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:46:validation fails and instructs the author to rerun `assemble`. Only an erratum absent from the
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:47:authoritative lesson binding is unrelated. Ambiguous reconstruction, incorrect populated references,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:48:or an `original` that no longer appears exactly once in its authoritative raw lesson/exercise target
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:49:fails rather than silently dropping the registered erratum.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:50:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:51:The edition author fills only `corrected`, updates the target text, and adds `math-correction` to that
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:52:target's `changes`. `adapt-finalize` rejects a missing record, wrong page or block, stale page hash,
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:53:original mismatch, unchanged propagation, or any formula change not reproduced by the registered
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/references/edition-text-contract.md:54:replacement.
.intentfold/readme.md:1:# .intentfold
.intentfold/readme.md:2:
.intentfold/readme.md:3:Read this first in every session. It is the single entry to project intent and ticket workflow.
.intentfold/readme.md:4:
.intentfold/readme.md:5:*Machine-owned: IntentFold cap1 refreshes this file. The four files in `charter/` are human-owned;
.intentfold/readme.md:6:do not edit them unless the human explicitly asks for a Charter change.*
.intentfold/readme.md:7:
.intentfold/readme.md:8:## Start here
.intentfold/readme.md:9:
.intentfold/readme.md:10:1. Read `.intentfold/project.json` for the project, main branch, ticket backend, deploy target, and
.intentfold/readme.md:11:   service ports.
.intentfold/readme.md:12:2. Read `charter/product.md` to understand what the product is, who it serves, and what it must not
.intentfold/readme.md:13:   become.
.intentfold/readme.md:14:3. Read `charter/engineering.md` before changing code or structure.
.intentfold/readme.md:15:4. Read `charter/ui.md` when the work touches a user interface.
.intentfold/readme.md:16:5. Read `charter/operations.md` when running, testing, querying, migrating, deploying, or operating
.intentfold/readme.md:17:   the product.
.intentfold/readme.md:18:6. Read the live ticket from the backend named by `project.json`, then its local artifacts under
.intentfold/readme.md:19:   `tickets/<ticket-id>/`.
.intentfold/readme.md:20:
.intentfold/readme.md:21:The Charter has exactly four files:
.intentfold/readme.md:22:
.intentfold/readme.md:23:| File | Owns |
.intentfold/readme.md:24:|---|---|
.intentfold/readme.md:25:| `product.md` | product purpose, users, value, and non-goals |
.intentfold/readme.md:26:| `engineering.md` | architecture, development rules, checks, dependencies, and landing |
.intentfold/readme.md:27:| `ui.md` | design system and interface constraints |
.intentfold/readme.md:28:| `operations.md` | local runtime, acceptance evidence, deployment, and operations |
.intentfold/readme.md:29:
.intentfold/readme.md:30:Requirements live in the ticket backend, not in a local `req.md`. Use the **n-plane** or
.intentfold/readme.md:31:**n-linear** skill selected by `project.json`. Linear ticket text is English; Plane ticket text is
.intentfold/readme.md:32:Chinese unless the human asks otherwise.
.intentfold/readme.md:33:
.intentfold/readme.md:34:## Charter format
.intentfold/readme.md:35:
.intentfold/readme.md:36:Every Charter file has these four headings, in this order, even when a section is empty:
.intentfold/readme.md:37:
.intentfold/readme.md:38:```markdown
.intentfold/readme.md:39:## Contract
.intentfold/readme.md:40:## Tools
.intentfold/readme.md:41:## Guidance
.intentfold/readme.md:42:## Redlines
.intentfold/readme.md:43:```
.intentfold/readme.md:44:
.intentfold/readme.md:45:They are different kinds of information:
.intentfold/readme.md:46:
.intentfold/readme.md:47:| Section | States | How it is used |
.intentfold/readme.md:48:|---|---|---|
.intentfold/readme.md:49:| `Contract` | what the artifact is | referenced while authoring |
.intentfold/readme.md:50:| `Tools` | commands, paths, ports, URLs, viewports | looked up at the moment of acting and run as written |
.intentfold/readme.md:51:| `Guidance` | how to approach the work | followed while writing |
.intentfold/readme.md:52:| `Redlines` | forbidden or approval-required actions | looked up before acting; never judged away |
.intentfold/readme.md:53:
.intentfold/readme.md:54:Use these tests when writing:
.intentfold/readme.md:55:
.intentfold/readme.md:56:1. **Contract or Guidance:** does the line describe the artifact, or the act of changing it?
.intentfold/readme.md:57:2. **Guidance or Redline:** can compliance be decided from a path, token, command, or structural
.intentfold/readme.md:58:   fact without reading and interpreting the implementation? If not, it is Guidance.
.intentfold/readme.md:59:3. **Tools:** could the concrete value go stale? Commands, paths, ports, URLs, and viewports belong
.intentfold/readme.md:60:   here once; other files point here rather than copy them.
.intentfold/readme.md:61:4. **Derive, do not enumerate:** a check derives targets from the product, manifest, sitemap, schema,
.intentfold/readme.md:62:   or registry and fails when derivation returns nothing. It does not preserve a second hand-written
.intentfold/readme.md:63:   list of routes, fields, or fixtures.
.intentfold/readme.md:64:
.intentfold/readme.md:65:Redlines live in the file whose subject they govern. There is no separate redline file. Each entry
.intentfold/readme.md:66:says either **forbidden outright** or **not without the human's explicit approval**.
.intentfold/readme.md:67:
.intentfold/readme.md:68:Write only what the code, configuration, schema, design system, or a command cannot answer more
.intentfold/readme.md:69:reliably. Prefer making a rule mechanical in `Tools` over emphasizing it in prose.
.intentfold/readme.md:70:
.intentfold/readme.md:71:## Ticket artifacts
.intentfold/readme.md:72:
.intentfold/readme.md:73:`tickets/<ticket-id>/` may contain:
.intentfold/readme.md:74:
.intentfold/readme.md:75:- `ticket.json` — mode, stage, finish, checkout, branch, base, and ports;
.intentfold/readme.md:76:- optional `draft.md`, `plan.md`, `ac.md`, and `grill.md`;
.intentfold/readme.md:77:- `handoff.md`, plus `intentfold-usage.json` when configured;
.intentfold/readme.md:78:- `rework.md` when the delivered branch changed after the first handoff;
.intentfold/readme.md:79:- `tmp/` for uncommitted evidence.
.intentfold/readme.md:80:
.intentfold/readme.md:81:The ticket backend decides whether work is live or Done. `handoff.md` freezes at first delivery;
.intentfold/readme.md:82:read it together with `rework.md`.
.intentfold/readme.md:83:
.intentfold/readme.md:84:Project scratch lives in `.intentfold/tmp/`. Scratch and environment files are not committed.
.intentfold/readme.md:85:
.intentfold/readme.md:86:## Workflow
.intentfold/readme.md:87:
.intentfold/readme.md:88:Use the **intentfold** skill:
.intentfold/readme.md:89:
.intentfold/readme.md:90:- cap1 initializes this harness;
.intentfold/readme.md:91:- cap2 files one ticket;
.intentfold/readme.md:92:- cap3 develops one ticket autonomously;
.intentfold/readme.md:93:- cap3setup prepares an open development phase;
.intentfold/readme.md:94:- cap3handoff verifies and records completed development;
.intentfold/readme.md:95:- cap4 merges and closes a verified ticket.
.intentfold/readme.md:96:
.intentfold/readme.md:97:No product change without a ticket.
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:1:---
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:2:name: ld-s10y-lesson
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:3:description: 按书名、章、节、连续编号单元、无编号补充习题或页码，把纯扫描的教材 PDF 抽成课程卡片——每张卡片一份完整课文 + 一组独立编号的题；原始图忠实抽取，现代 edition 图委托项目技能 ld-s10y-image 生成。正文图留正文，共享练习图只展示一次。用于无文字层的老教材数字化。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:4:---
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:5:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:6:# ld-s10y-lesson
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:7:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:8:**扫描教材 PDF → 按单元成课、按题成件。**
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:9:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:10:适用判据：`pdffonts book.pdf` 无嵌入字体、`pdftotext` 提取 0 字符 → 该书没有文字层，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:11:所有"抽取文字层"的工具都会输出空白，必须走视觉转写。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:12:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:13:开始读源页、图稿或验收截图前，遵守
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:14:[图片批次规则](../../../.agents/skills/ld-s10y-image/SKILL.md#image-batches)；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:15:本流程及其子代理共用该规则，完成一批并返回文字结果后再处理新批次。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:16:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:17:批量生产、接续检查点或处理执行故障时，先读
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:18:[小批次与技术恢复](references/production-resume.md)。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:19:调用方的暂停及离线授权优先于下文的默认发布流程。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:20:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:21:## 用户入口与术语
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:22:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:23:- **卡片**是最小可发布内容项：有编号 `topics[]` 时父节只作结构；`topics[]` 全部无编号时，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:24:  父节本身是主课卡，子项是随后排列的补充阅读卡。`kind: "exercises"` 的无编号补充习题或
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:25:  难题也是卡片。编号单元的 `printedNumber` 在全书连续；无编号卡片的 `number` 合法地为
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:26:  `null`，由 TOC 的 `id`、名称和起始页认领
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:27:- **章**对应 `contents[]`，**节**对应 `lessons[]`；它们用于辅助定位单元
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:28:- 书可用 book id 或书名；先在 `ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/toc/` 找到唯一 TOC
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:29:- 支持「5m 第 8 单元」「5m 第 5–7 单元」「5m 第一章第一节第 5 单元」
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:30:  「5m 第一章『正数和负数』§1『集合的运算』第 5 单元『分类』」和直接给 PDF 页码
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:31:- 编号、层级和标题同时出现时要互相校验；能唯一定位就直接执行，只有冲突或不唯一时才问
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:32:- 从目标单元的 `page` 和下一单元的 `page` 推导印刷页范围，再按本书 PDF 偏移换成物理页；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:33:  为闭合跨页正文或习题，可以向前后多取边界页，但只发布已完整的目标单元
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:34:- 整章生成时先从 TOC 展开该章的全部可发布卡片，**包括章末 `kind: "exercises"`**；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:35:  章节右边界是下一章或下一同级条目的起始印刷页。为闭合对象临时多取的边界页，如果只含
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:36:  下一章内容，不进入本章提交、索引或发布集合
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:37:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:38:## 抽一批页的标准流程
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:39:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:40:用户通常只会给一句话：**「抽 5m 第 21–31 页」**或**「抽完 5、6、7 单元」**。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:41:这句话同时授权把指定且已完整的单元 upsert 到生产内容库。默认按下面整套走到底，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:42:直到产品中实际可见，不要停在中间：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:43:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:44:```bash
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:45:set -e
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:46:P=.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/.venv/bin/python
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:47:S=.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/p2c.py
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:48:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:49:for n in $(seq 21 31); do $P $S prepare --book 5m --page $n; done   # ① 在 .tmp 备料
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:50:#   ② 逐页读 .tmp 中的 page.grid.png/template，把 page.md 写入持久 pages/<page>/
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:51:for n in $(seq 21 31); do $P $S finalize --book 5m --page $n; done  # ③ 收口，必须全绿
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:52:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:53:$P $S assemble  --book 5m --toc ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/toc/5m/zh.json
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:54:$P $S vectorize --book 5m
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:55:$P $S assemble  --book 5m --toc ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/toc/5m/zh.json
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:56:$P $S adapt-prepare --book 5m --edition modern-us-neutral \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:57:  --lesson math5-c1-s1-n5 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n6 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n7
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:58:# ④ 只编辑 editions/modern-us-neutral 下的模板，改写主题；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:59:#    所有现代图委托 ld-s10y-image，按 deterministic / hybrid / generated 路由
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:60:$P $S adapt-finalize --book 5m --edition modern-us-neutral \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:61:  --lesson math5-c1-s1-n5 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n6 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n7
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:62:$P $S render --book 5m --edition modern-us-neutral \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:63:  --lesson math5-c1-s1-n5 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n6 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n7
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:64:node .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/publish.mjs \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:65:  ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:66:  --edition modern-us-neutral \
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:67:  --lesson math5-c1-s1-n5 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n6 --lesson math5-c1-s1-n7
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:68:# ⑤ 按 ld-s10y-answer 的 cap2、cap3 为同一批 lesson 依次发布答案键和交互规格
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:69:cd app && npm run dev
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:70:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:71:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:72:- `assemble` 的 `--toc` **不能省**：课的 id 是从教材目录认领的，没有它产品里就没有地址
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:73:- ③ 和 `assemble` 的对账**不通过就是没做完**，回到 ② 修，不允许放行
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:74:- `finalize` 必须可重复执行：同一 `page.png` 和同一已收口图框要复用上次审计中的精确
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:75:  几何信息，禁止再次把精确框当粗框吸附，造成裁图像素和下游 FigureSpec 哈希漂移
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:76:- `vectorize` 后必须再跑一次 `assemble`，把页目录中新生成的 SVG 同步到全书图库
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:77:- 原始 `pages/`、`figures/`、`lessons/` 和 `book.json` 是忠实抽取层，生成现代版时不得修改
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:78:- `adapt-prepare` 后只编辑 `editions/<edition>/`；改写后的 JSON 和新图必须通过
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:79:  `adapt-finalize`，生产发布器不接受原始抽取层
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:80:- 现代 edition 的正文由工具按完整语句和单独引出的公式确定性分行，再把连续 2–3 个语句
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:81:  组成可独立显示的短段落；完整的数字、拉丁字母或西里尔字母分题序列必须统一成自然顺序，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:82:  且题干前缀和每个分题各自独占一行。`adapt-finalize` 会重写已有 edition，不允许连续
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:83:  大段正文、错序或横向分题通过
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:84:- 现代 edition 中的中文顿号、逗号、分号、句号、问号、叹号和冒号必须放在 `$...$`
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:85:  数学区外；拆开相邻公式只属于 `layout` 变更。数学内容默认保持原式；只有忠实页已登记、
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:86:  且页哈希、块引用和原式全部匹配的 `errata` 才能在现代层改为修正式。工具必须始终从
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:87:  权威页流和装订身份核验来源绑定：旧 lesson 缺 `source_refs` 时重建，非空引用与权威绑定
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:88:  不一致时明确失败；无法唯一确认、绑定错误或原式漂移都不得把本课已登记勘误静默丢弃
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:89:- edition lesson 用 `section_breaks` 的 `{before, after}` 相邻段落文本标记真正的概念切换。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:90:  先运行 `node .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/prose_flow.mjs <lesson.template.json>` 查看
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:91:  `proseFlow` 的最终段落，再复制工具输出的 boundary 对象；禁止按 prose 块或换行手算整数。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:92:  `adapt-finalize`、离线渲染和发布均调用同一 `htmlfrag.js` 解析
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:93:- 现代正文中的公式外 ASCII 数字和拉丁字母由发布器、离线渲染器自动标记；作者只写正文和
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:94:  `$...$` 公式，禁止手工包 `<span>`。产品与离线 HTML 都必须让这些字符和行内 KaTeX 使用
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:95:  KaTeX Main，并以中文正文的 `1.10em` 显示，避免同一句中的数学字符换字体或显得偏小
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:96:- `render` 不是发布门禁，但必须用于离线视觉检查；它读取指定 edition，不得回退原书
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:97:- 边界页常会带出下一节开头；它必须完整转写以通过页级对账，但**不得发布未完成的下一节**。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:98:  用可重复的 `--lesson <cardId>` 只发布本次已完成的单元
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:99:- **不允许以 `--dry` 作为交付终点**。dry-run 只能用于发布前检查，之后必须真实写库
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:100:- 写库后查询 `sr_lessons` 核对目标 id 的正文块数和题数，再启动 app，用浏览器逐节确认
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:101:  目录可点、正文准确（原书无正文时允许为空）、插图清晰、习题数量正确、控制台无错误
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:102:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:103:## 交付的是对象，不是页
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:104:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:105:页是扫描的产物，不是内容的单位。要交付的两个对象——**单元**和**题**——都不认页
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:106:边界：一道题会跨页，一段课文会被插图从中间截断，一张图的引用可能在邻页。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:107:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:108:所以整条管线围绕对象组织：cap1 认出对象并标好"是否续到下页"，cap2 按标记拼接。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:109:**页级的东西只剩两样**：像素（裁图要它）和一条行数对账（页级唯一的完整性硬证据）。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:110:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:111:## 分工：模型认对象，机器管像素
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:112:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:113:这是本技能最重要的一条，不要退回去。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:114:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:115:纯机械的图/文判据（长横线、连通域高度、尺寸下限）试过并放弃了：每换一种版面就得
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:116:加一条规则，补了五轮仍在漏——图题被裁进插图、坐标轴被行带拦腰切断、页码被切成
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:117:三截、文字环绕的插图把整段题面烙进图里。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:118:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:119:模型一眼就能看出哪块是插图、哪块是半张被撕掉的表、哪一段是第几题，**但给不出准确
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:120:像素坐标**。机器恰好相反。于是：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:121:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:122:| 谁 | 干什么 |
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:123:|---|---|
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:124:| 模型（看图） | 认对象：这是插图/表/第几题/哪一节；画个**粗框**；判断是否续到下页 |
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:125:| 机器（确定性） | 把粗框**吸附**到连通域上、裁图、矢量化、跨页拼接、全书对账 |
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:126:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:127:吸附实测：粗框 `[780,1630,510,270]` → `[793,1643,488,244]`，与逐像素检测一致。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:128:框歪十几像素、小一圈都能救回来，读图时照着网格估就够了。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:129:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:130:## 对账是对象级的
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:131:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:132:页级像素对账（每一处墨迹归属某个块）代价大、判据脆。真正有力的是对象级对账，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:133:既便宜又强，而且直接对着交付目标：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:134:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:135:1. **题号连续** —— 先按 source manifest 的 `exerciseNumbering` 确认范围：`book` 检查全书，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:136:   `lesson` 逐课检查，`lesson-group` 逐课、逐栏目检查。开始处理一本新书前，必须核对源 PDF、
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:137:   TOC 和编号范围；不能根据其它物理教材推断本书也采用全书连续编号。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:138:2. **图号连续** —— `图 1..图 N` 无缺号。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:139:3. **引用双向齐全** —— 正文里提到的每个「图 N」都存在；每张图都至少被引用一次。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:140:4. **TOC 覆盖** —— 目录说这段页码里有几个单元，就该装订出几个单元。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:141:5. **公式 KaTeX** —— 在**拼完整之后**校验：跨页残片在单页上必然配不平，义务推到 cap2。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:142:6. **行数对账**（页级，唯一保留的）—— 挖掉插图后的印刷行数 == 块体行数。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:143:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:144:## 目录布局
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:145:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:146:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:147:ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/sources/soviet10years/5m ….pdf
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:148:ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:149:├── pages/0015/              ← cap1 持久页级事实
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:150:│   ├── page.md              ★ 带类型的块
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:151:│   ├── page.json            结构化视图（cap2 的输入）
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:152:│   └── audit.json           行数、框和规范化审计
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:153:├── figures/fig-07.png|svg   ← 全书图库，按**原书图号**命名，跨页唯一
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:154:├── lessons/2-交集/          ← ★ 课程单元
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:155:│   ├── lesson.json          课文块 + 元数据
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:156:│   ├── lesson.md            完整课文（跨页、跨图都接好）
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:157:│   ├── exercises.json       ★ 每题独立：题号、栏目、题干、图号引用；共享图只挂到一题展示
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:158:├── editions/modern-us-neutral/
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:159:│   ├── figures/             ★ ld-s10y-image 产物 + 每图一份 FigureSpec
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:160:│   ├── lessons/<card-id>/   ★ 可发布的现代 lesson/exercises/figures JSON + 审计
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:161:│   └── book.json            edition 索引
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:162:└── book.json                全书索引 + 审计报告
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:163:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:164:.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/5m/
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:165:├── pages/0015/
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:166:│   ├── page.png / page.grid.png / layout.json / page.template.md
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:167:│   └── figures/fig-07.png|svg
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:168:└── render/<edition>/<card-id>/{text,exercises}.html
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:169:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:170:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:171:**book id = 书名首段**（`5m`、`8a`、`9-10g`）。默认跨
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:172:`ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/sources/` 下的书系列查找，撞名用 `--series`。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:173:`.tmp/` 中的页面渲染、模板、页级裁图和离线 HTML 可随时删除；重新 `prepare`、`finalize`、
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:174:`vectorize`、`assemble` 即可恢复。持久 JSON 不得引用 `.tmp/`。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:175:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:176:工具入口：`.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/.venv/bin/python .claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/tools/p2c.py`
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:177:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:178:依赖引导（缺失时）：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:179:```bash
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:180:uv venv <skill>/.venv --python 3.13
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:181:uv pip install --python <skill>/.venv/bin/python numpy pillow scipy potracer
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:182:cd <skill> && npm install katex @resvg/resvg-js
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:183:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:184:`scipy` 吸附连通域，`potracer` 描摹 SVG，`katex` 校验公式，`resvg` 校验 SVG 保真——
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:185:都不是可选的。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:186:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:187:---
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:188:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:189:## cap1 — 单页识别
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:190:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:191:```bash
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:192:p2c.py prepare  --book 5m --page 15     # 在 .tmp 渲染整页 + 100px 坐标网格图
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:193:#  ↓ 读 .tmp 中的 page.grid.png/template，写 artifacts/5m/pages/0015/page.md
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:194:p2c.py finalize --book 5m --page 15     # 吸附裁图 + 规范化 + 页级体检
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:195:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:196:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:197:**逐页识别，不要多页一起喂。** 视觉模型的图像 token 预算固定，一次两页就等于把每页
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:198:分辨率减半；这批书恰好卡在这上面——西里尔 `а б в` 与拉丁 `a b e` 字形完全相同、
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:199:`⩽` 和 `≤` 只差一根横线，都是靠像素分辨的。需要跨页上下文时**传上一页的尾部文字**，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:200:不要传像素。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:201:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:202:### 块格式
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:203:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:204:md 里每块前面一行块头声明它是什么；块体里**一行 = 印刷一行**（行数对账靠这个）。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:205:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:206:```markdown
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:207:<!-- h1 --> 章    <!-- h2 --> §    <!-- h3 --> 单元标题
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:208:<!-- p -->        正文段
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:209:<!-- exhead -->   习题栏标题（复习题 / 家庭作业题）
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:210:<!-- ex 20 -->    第 20 题，20 是原书题号
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:211:<!-- fig 图 7 box 790,1640,490,250 -->   插图/表格，框照网格估
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:212:<!-- fig 表 box 790,1640,490,250 owner-ex 20 --> 无编号练习图，明确归第 20 题
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:213:<!-- cap 图 7 --> 印刷出来的图题行       <!-- foot --> 页码
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:214:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:215:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:216:四个标记：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:217:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:218:- `open` —— 这个对象还没完，下面接着（**跨页、也跨插图**）
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:219:- `cont` —— 承接上一个同类对象
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:220:- `samerow` —— 本块与上一块共享印刷行（正文右侧的图题、并排的两个图题）；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:221:  多行 `cap` 表示每一行都与相邻图题或正文同排，其他块只表示首行同排
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:222:- `labelrow` —— `ex` 块的小问标号在方程横排之间另占一条独立印刷行；
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:223:  只在原像素确证时使用，并排两组共享该行只加一行。完整公式和标号照常保留，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:224:  不重复标号、不增加虚假的公式 `↵`；JSON 用 `offset_label_row: true` 记录此事实
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:225:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:226:一个被插图从中间截断的段落，写成 `p open` … `fig` … `p cont`，cap2 会接成一段。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:227:配对时 `fig`/`cap`/`foot` 是透明的。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:228:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:229:### 转写要点
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:230:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:231:- **图题是文字**，单独成 `cap` 块；装订时跟随对应图的语义归属，不能一律塞进正文
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:232:- 一个「图 N」由几幅小图组成时整体一个框（语义上就是一张图）；框之间不许重叠
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:233:- 不带图号、题面也无法引用的练习表格或图，必须在 `fig` 块头写
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:234:  `owner-ex <稳定题目标识>`；同一课跨栏目重复印刷题号时用栏目限定标识（如 `g2-1`），
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:235:  不能只写有歧义的 `1`。这是归属的唯一事实来源，禁止靠页内最近距离猜测
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:236:- 半张表、撕掉一角的表：**按印出来的样子截**，缺口照留，写进 `notes`
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:237:- 页边缘、书脊或相邻页透出的重复字迹属于扫描串页，不是本页内容；对照相邻页确认后不写入
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:238:  块。无法确认时记入 `notes`，不得把可疑残片并进题干
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:239:- 一条公式被印刷从中间切开：公式写完整，断点处写 `↵`（行数照样对得上，公式也配得平）
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:240:- 大括号连接的多行方程组仍按各条方程的实际印刷行计数；并排方程组的同一横排只计一次。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:241:  若完整转写与像素行带不符，先核对扫描里的独立行，再修计数器并验证多行正例和单行
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:242:  分式反例；禁止少写 `↵`、删除方程或改题面来迎合错误的行数。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:243:- frontmatter 填 `printed_page`、`notes`；确认的数学印刷错误另填 `errata`，包含稳定 `id`、
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:244:  本页块引用、忠实 `original` 和核验 `reason`。哈希一类字段收口时用事实覆盖，不要手抄
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:245:- 印刷行末若本该有一个空格（半角句点后、中英之间），**把空格写在行尾**——
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:246:  拼接是直接首尾相接的，行尾不留空格，句子接起来就粘住了
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:247:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:248:数学与字符由 `profiles/soviet-cn.json` 强制：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:249:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:250:- 行内 `$...$`；上下标一律 LaTeX（`x^2`），禁止 `x²`；分式 `\frac`，禁 `\dfrac`
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:251:- 数学区内减号用 ASCII `-`，禁 `−`(U+2212)
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:252:- **习题小问标号必须是西里尔** `а) б) в)`——与拉丁 `a) b) e)` 字形完全相同，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:253:  只能按码点写对。这是最常见的错误来源
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:254:- 苏联教材用法式区间记号 `]a, b[`，**照抄，禁止改成 `(a, b)`**
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:255:- 含中文的集合 `{俄语、数学}`、含全角标点的数组 `{52 164，32 415}` 写成普通文本，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:256:  不要塞进 `$...$`——CJK 混进数学区是"公式看着对、渲染歪"的主要来源
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:257:- 原书印错、破损、污点：**照抄原样**。不确定的识别问题记进 `notes`；确认的数学印刷错误
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:258:  还要登记 `errata`，例如
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:259:  `{"id":"p0013-math-1","block":"p0013#7","original":"$原式$","reason":"代入值核验不成立"}`。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:260:  `finalize` 会拒绝不存在的块、找不到的原式和重复 id
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:261:- 确认的题号误印仍保留块头与题面印刷号；只在 frontmatter 的
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:262:  `exercise_numbering_errata` 登记 `{id, block, printed, corrected, reason}`，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:263:  号值均用字符串，`block` 绑定本页非 `cont` 习题的精确引用。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:264:  独立源审确认印刷号、连续编号上下文唯一确定顺序号后才能登记。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:265:  装订的 `number` 使用修正顺序号，`source_number` 保留印刷号，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:266:  `numbering_erratum` 保留绑定证据；全书对账和书后答案引用使用该修正顺序号，
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:267:  不得把前文同印刷号题的答案绑定到这里。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:268:- 行数失败时对照原页与遮图后的行带：高分式的分子分母属于同一印刷行，扫描黑边和
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:269:  残留表格边线不是文字；嵌套分式的短分子、分母也可能因页边细线干扰而误拆。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:270:  先核对行带和横向归属，再修复实际计行缺陷并补独立预期的正反例，禁止加空行、重复文字
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:271:  或伪造 `↵` 凑数。下一页只有同一题的插图时，用 `owner-ex` 绑定，不写空 `ex cont` 块。
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:272:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:273:---
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:274:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:275:## cap2 — 跨页装订
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:276:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:277:```bash
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:278:p2c.py assemble --book 5m [--toc <toc.json>]
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:279:```
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:280:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:281:四步纯拼接，不需要再猜（cap1 已经把类型和 open/cont 标好了）：
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:282:
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:283:1. **合流** —— `open` 的块与后面 `cont` 的块接成一个对象
.claude/skills/ld-s10y-lesson/SKILL.md:284:2. **切单元** —— `h3` 开一个单元，`h1`/`h2` 是它的祖先标题
